 "resumo_pt": "Barclay James Harvest é uma banda inglesa de Rock Progressivo/Rock sinfónico,com influências na música clássica. A banda foi fundada em Saddleworth, perto de Oldham Lancashire, Inglaterra, em setembro de 1966.",
 "resumo_en": "Barclay James Harvest is an English progressive rock band which, following a split in 1998, now exist as two successor bands. They were founded in Oldham in September 1966 by bassist/vocalist Les Holroyd (born 1948), guitarist/vocalist John Lees (born 1947), drummer/percussionist Mel Pritchard (1948–2004), and keyboardist/vocalist Stuart \"Woolly\" Wolstenholme (1947–2010).",
